          "description": "Full AI-powered government procurement search with Claude Sonnet intelligence. Returns a compact ranked summary of 10 matches showing title, match score, region, type, value, and deadline. Costs 1 credit. Always searches globally across all sources to find the best matches. After reviewing the summary, use **get_opportunity** with a result number (1-10) to see the full strategic fit memo, political context memo, description, and application URL for any match - at no extra cost.",
